    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"6642\" data-end=\"6669\">Level 10 — <strong data-start=\"6656\" data-end=\"6669\">Dread Cut</strong></h2><p data-start=\"6671\" data-end=\"6687\">Fear propagates.</p><h3 data-start=\"6689\" data-end=\"6711\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"6712\" data-end=\"6740\">When you hit at <strong data-start=\"6728\" data-end=\"6739\">Burn 2+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"6741\" data-end=\"6861\"><li data-start=\"6741\" data-end=\"6780\"><p data-start=\"6743\" data-end=\"6780\">Target must save or be <strong data-start=\"6766\" data-end=\"6780\">Shaken</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6861\"><p data-start=\"6783\" data-end=\"6861\">Nearby enemies must save or suffer <strong data-start=\"6818\" data-end=\"6832\">hesitation</strong> (lose movement or reactions)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6863\" data-end=\"6878\">At <strong data-start=\"6866\" data-end=\"6877\">Burn 4+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"6879\" data-end=\"6934\"><li data-start=\"6879\" data-end=\"6934\"><p data-start=\"6881\" data-end=\"6934\">Fear spreads automatically to one additional creature</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6936\" data-end=\"6956\">Dread is contagious.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
